Clean manufacturing and contamination control — from familiar objects to controlled processes (@clean-manufacturing: 0, is #chapter, #clean-manufacturing "foundations/Reading-clean-manufacturing-from-familiar-objects.lingua#r_31VJJ9S9CV7GZP136B19YCZW5N") { r_7D8SQ8BVQDZQBDBGC6DP0JAMZN
Understand how unwanted material changes a useful object or process, and how design, measurement and continuing work preserve the needed conditions. Begin with familiar objects, arithmetic and material vocabulary before studying transport, equipment and specialized manufacturing.

**Begin:** [Read clean manufacturing from familiar objects to controlled processes](foundations/Reading-clean-manufacturing-from-familiar-objects.lingua#r_31VJJ9S9CV7GZP136B19YCZW5N).

The opening connects size and scale, particles and films, microbial material, cleaning and preservation with sampling, calibration, counting evidence and operating states. Original calculations distinguish number from mass, deposited area from film thickness, a sample result from an unobserved population and filter performance from bypass. Shared foundations remain the same Records used elsewhere.

Read the complete cleanroom-programming guide, the NASA contamination-control report, the aerosol-calibration chapter, selected substantial microbiology chapters and the sterile-production guidance progressively. The air-cleaning handbook supports deeper filtration and system study. [First investigations of cleanliness and evidence](studies/First-investigations-of-cleanliness-and-evidence.lingua#r_62FS07J8WV8V8F8HW5Y00G46NE) branches into sensitive-surface, air-sampling and aseptic-process investigations before [Explain the foundations before designing the facility](studies/Explain-the-foundations-before-designing-the-facility.lingua#r_4Q8V901XVQ8PTKRGG5Y26MVY5N).

Continue through [Read particle transport from one particle to a population](particles/Read-particle-transport-from-one-particle-to-a-population.lingua#r_0XFQY53MK47KMCAWNES4DWDR8N): particle/fluid scales, corrected drag, measured mobility, relaxation, settling, inertia, shape, Brownian and electrical motion. Pair encounters and population balances distinguish particle number from conserved material. Conservative spatial transport, boundary conditions, collectors and turbulence lead to [An inspectable particle-column calculation](computation/An-inspectable-particle-column-calculation.lingua#r_71QKY85BV2TV2Z1EKF6KPG92H2), an original settling/diffusion model with independent analytic and numerical checks. Three further investigations of mobility, collection and population dynamics rejoin at [Review transport before changing the surface or facility](studies/Review-transport-before-changing-the-surface-or-facility.lingua#r_7RP133RW9C9HH2M0G9ZFW0012D).

Continue into [Read surfaces from contact history to measured removal](surfaces/Read-surfaces-from-contact-history-to-measured-removal.lingua#r_17J6HNWM403V06B2KQXWMXAAXG): surface history, interaction energy and force, contact deformation, JKR/DMT limits, roughness, charge, wetting and capillary bridges. Removal modes and measurement lead to population inference, molecular coverage and surface reservoirs. Three investigations of contact, wetting and retention rejoin at [Review surfaces before choosing cleaning chemistry](studies/Review-surfaces-before-choosing-cleaning-chemistry.lingua#r_4XZBGNRTFEMMCYYE2GGA1HSSBG).

Continue through [Read cleaning through chemistry, transport and restored function](cleaning/Read-cleaning-through-chemistry-transport-and-restored-function.lingua#r_5A3XBM9923FKVXG10QYDMF4EH5): residue identity and recovery, dissolution, acid/base and metal equilibria, surfactants, ionic screening and colloid interactions. Solvent, aqueous, acoustic and dry methods connect removal to compatibility. Quantitative rinsing, retained regions, drying, molecular contamination and preservation lead into three investigations of residue analysis, rinse systems and sensitive manufacturing. They rejoin at [Review cleaning before designing the facility and its controls](studies/Review-cleaning-before-designing-the-facility-and-its-controls.lingua#r_1GWH14SX8FEJ49VV0SN0XDAM06).

Continue into [Read the facility as a connected physical system](facilities/Read-the-facility-as-a-connected-physical-system.lingua#r_2YXB39EGSDN2NAJP1RWEBHE0VQ): process requirements, layout, barriers, people, installed materials and air circuits. Room recovery, size-dependent filtration, bypass, fan/system behavior and coupled pressure/contaminant networks lead into buoyancy, door transfers, heat, moisture, utility dependencies and control. Three investigations of air cleaning, pressure/transfer and energy/control rejoin at [Review the facility before qualifying its performance](studies/Review-the-facility-before-qualifying-its-performance.lingua#r_0BZHWZQZAKQ0NY2JHYWRF4WG6P).

Continue through [Read an aerosol measurement from inlet to inference](aerosol-measurement/Read-an-aerosol-measurement-from-inlet-to-inference.lingua#r_5Q1DVBR0RM9WQBVBNRY5ZG5PWJ): sampling boundaries, volume and state, aspiration, line losses, conditioning and timing. Optical, condensation, aerodynamic and mobility responses lead to counting statistics, response matrices, inverse problems, calibration and uncertainty. Three investigations of the sampling chain, counter calibration and size inference rejoin at [Review what the aerosol measurements establish](studies/Review-what-the-aerosol-measurements-establish.lingua#r_29HS8QY95V57MXZ2W8TS62TDEZ).

Continue through [Read surface evidence from the object to the result](surface-measurement/Read-surface-evidence-from-the-object-to-the-result.lingua#r_51G8C1ZYP11D61TWTBRD867Y4A): spatial and depth weighting, specimen history, imaging, recovery, chemical evidence and calibration. Photoelectron response, attenuation, heterogeneous films and depth profiles lead to complementary observations and method validation. Three investigations of images, residues and film inference rejoin at [Review the evidence about the surface](studies/Review-the-evidence-about-the-surface.lingua#r_6ZT8HE7DSJ064B1VX5QCS4DWC8).

Continue through [Read qualification and monitoring as continuing evidence](qualification/Read-qualification-and-monitoring-as-continuing-evidence.lingua#r_20YVNVS9BP8X46CQRJK6KQ5ZVX): installed configuration, operating domains, sampling, acceptance decisions and uncertainty. Baselines, count and rate models, control charts, dependence, multivariate evidence and capability lead to change investigation. Three investigations join qualification, monitoring and acceptance at [Review what qualification and monitoring have established](studies/Review-what-qualification-and-monitoring-have-established.lingua#r_45F6FDPJHZ5MG7Y0K55BMA3H0X).

**Sources:** [Books and primary sources for clean manufacturing](Sources.lingua#r_3AA0Q34WMJ3580S9QP4CZ24AG0).

This subject is in development. Continuing operation, specialist transport and production, and independent research remain in [the development scope](../../../../lince/Trails.lingua#r_47NQ213DRJK1AMKQX7DTXR8E6X).

**TODO — sensitive data:** Specialist microbial laboratory methods are deferred after a reported stop involving sensitive biological source material. Preserve their importance to contamination control; further coverage must remain within safe scientific context, interpretation and concise caution. Continue with specialist manufacturing and continuing operation. This portion remains unfinished.

Continue through [Production and quality](../Production.lingua#r_2Y7YR9YHGPS7CWXQ7R4SAJVBR4) and [Hephaestus](../../Hephaestus.lingua#r_00000000000000000000002001). [Gas and vacuum systems](../../utilities/industrial-gases-vacuum-and-high-purity-supplies/Industrial-gases-and-vacuum.lingua#r_3GHQJEYMYEN6JDKSF4PPJ403RF) develop a connected utility. Questions about evidence and purpose return to [Philosophy](../../../../scholazein/philosophy/Philosophy.lingua#r_00000000000000000000001001).

} r_7D8SQ8BVQDZQBDBGC6DP0JAMZN
